WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You are giving directions. You are looking at the person asking.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Now a door crosses between you.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Behind it, the questioner changes.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
In a 1998 field experiment, only half detected the switch.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Attention to a conversation is not a complete picture of every detail.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence. Try a free routine.
